<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Welcome! This platform was created to help international students navigate higher education in South Korea without the burden of heavy financial debt."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		While many prospective students only know about major government scholarships 
		like GKS, there are many direct pathways to study in Korea 
		with 100% tuition waivers, professor-funded lab stipends, and research assistantships.
	</p>

	<p>
		My Mission : Navigating admissions, finding lab openings, and emailing professors can feel overwhelming. 
		My goal is to make this process transparent and accessible by providing:

		* **Step-by-Step Roadmaps:** Clear, actionable guides on application timelines and requirements.
		* **Direct Funding Strategies:** Practical advice on securing lab stipends (RA/TA) directly from professors.
		* **Community Support:** A space for prospective students to ask questions, share updates, and help each other succeed.
	</p>

	<p>
		Have questions or want to share feedback? 
		Feel free to reach out via 
		[LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-profile) 
		or send an email directly to **marhamidhatiey@gmail.com**. 
		You can also join the discussion on our **[Forum](/forum)**!

	</p>

